cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MaDI-Bench, please cite the following work."
title: "MaDI-Bench: An End-to-End Data Integration Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  MaDI-Bench is the first public benchmark for the end-to-end integration of
  relational tables, covering schema matching, value normalization, entity
  blocking, entity matching, and data fusion. It provides 20 integration tasks
  across five domains (Games, Companies, Music, Products, Scientific Papers)
  with ground truth for every step and for the integrated output, plus a
  variant-generation method for deriving easy, medium, and hard variants.
